# Level 49, reached by password XWJR, then the *other* second weapon picked up
# and fired -- collision id $5E, which nothing in the project had ever produced.
#
# `movies/level17-weapon.zmv` was the first input to fire anything but the
# squirt gun, and it fires $5D, the ice weapon. This is its twin. Every copy of
# $81:8888 keeps two branches for the two ids the damage table does not
# describe; the $5D one has been served by `enemy_freeze` since the level-17
# round and the $5E one declined to $81:83C6, which no input reached.
#
# **Which object gives which weapon was read off the ROM rather than guessed.**
# Each weapon has its own shot spawner and each spawner its own two-word id
# table -- one entry per player, the second with bit 15 set -- so searching the
# ROM for `5E 00 5E 80` finds exactly one address, $81:F4C6, and the eight
# weapons come out as $81:FEC3 ($5C), $81:FC0A ($5D), $81:F4C6 ($5E),
# $81:EA0C ($5F), $81:EB9E ($60), $81:EDAB ($61), $81:FACD/$81:FC0E ($62) and
# $81:F6B8 ($63). $80:D219 selects with `LDA $1CBC,X : ASL A : TAY : LDA
# ($64),Y`, so $1CBC is an inventory *slot*; $80:CA30 turns object type $04 into
# collision id $0E, which $80:F87B puts in slot 2. Slot 0 is $5C and slot 1 is
# $5D, so slot 2 should be $5E -- and `--records` says it is, which is what makes
# this a measurement rather than a guess.
#
# The route is `tools/fit_route.py` from (30,300) to the type-$04 object at
# (105,86), 24 legs with Y held, then B once. Level 49 places the only such
# object any password-reachable level puts within reach: level 21's is across
# water (the router walks in and drowns, from either side) and level 41's is most
# of a map away -- 43 legs of fitting and it never arrived.
#
# The tail is the twelve-leg box the nine level-N probes walk, because what this
# is measured by is the census rather than where it ends up.
#
# What it bought: `$81:AC92`, 290 declines, the ninth copy of $81:8888 -- and
# `$81:845E` and `$81:83C6` through `movies/level49-corner.zmv`, which is this
# movie with the B press taken out and does not stay a control. It also found a
# divergence in `sprite_build_oam` that had been there for forty-one routines:
# see docs/cosim.md, *The pass that is not only the scheduler's*.
#
